    "name": "Chillax Heritage",
    "detail": "We started our Thailand trip at Chillax Resort in a premium room facing the street. It was beautiful. The hotel had arranged flowers and towel art for our anniversary. The tub is enormous! We liked the resort so much, we stayed again at the end of our trip. Chillax Heritage is in the best location in Bangkok. It is within easy walking distance to the river, where you can buy boat tickets to take you to most of the main temples and attractions in Bangkok. It is also within easy walking distance to Khaosan Road, where you can find delicious food and amazing cheap massages. The hotel is serene, clean, and quiet. We loved it! ",
